<title>USA: GOLF-THIRD ROUND LEADERS AT DORAL-RYDER OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-THIRD ROUND LEADERS AT DORAL-RYDER OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders after the third round of</p>
<p>the $1.8 million Doral-Ryder Open golf tournament on Saturday</p>
<p>(U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>204 David Duval 68 66 70</p>
<p>205 Nick Price (Zimbabwe) 68 67 70</p>
<p>206 Steve Elkington (Australia) 70 66 70</p>
<p>207 Larry Nelson 72 66 69, Bob Tway 66 71 70</p>
<p>208 Ronnie Black 67 71 70, Phil Mickelson 69 68 71, Greg</p>
<p>Norman (Australia) 66 68 74</p>
<p>209 Peter Jacobsen 70 71 68, Robert Damron 72 66 71</p>
<p>210 Craig Stadler 71 72 67, Wayne Levi 70 72 68, Jerry Kelly</p>
<p>71 70 69, Fulton Allem (South Africa) 70 70 70, Chris Perry 71</p>
<p>67 72</p>
<p>211 Bruce Lietzke 69 70 72, Ted Tryba 70 69 72, Colin</p>
<p>Montgomerie (Britain) 69 69 73</p>
<p>212 Steve Lowery 72 71 69, Lee Rinker 66 74 72, Doug Martin</p>
<p>67 71 74, Jesper Parnevik (Sweden) 72 66 74, Stewart Cink 67</p>
<p>74 71</p>
<p>Add non-U.S. scores</p>
<p>213 Vijay Singh (Fiji) 72 72 69</p>
<p>214 Craig Parry (Australia) 70 70 74, Nick Faldo (Britain) 71</p>
